# Tooling Conventions

## 1. Testing

- Unit tests: `pnpm test:unit` runs colocated Vitest tests in Node.js.
- Component tests: Vitest with @vitest/browser-playwright.
- E2E tests: Playwright directly.
- Test files: **/*.test.ts or **/*.spec.ts.
- Colocate tests next to source files OR in __tests__/ folders — be consistent.

## 2. Linting & Formatting

- ESLint uses flat config (eslint.config.mjs). Do NOT create .eslintrc.json.
- Prettier with prettier-plugin-tailwindcss for class sorting.
- Husky + lint-staged runs linting and formatting on commit.
- ALWAYS run pnpm typecheck before pushing.

## 3. PWA (Serwist)

- Serwist handles the service worker. Do NOT write a custom service worker from scratch.
- PWA config lives in src/app/sw.ts (or as configured).
- Use @serwist/turbopack integration. Do NOT manually register SW in layout.
